            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of postural orthostatic tachycardia syndrome and inappropriate sinus tachycardia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>402-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postural orthostatic tachycardia syndrome and inappropriate sinus tachycardia are two clinically different entities but with significant overlap of symptoms. Treatment by and large is medical; however, other modalities of treatment are being evaluated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
